  "note": "Kalverstraat 195, 197 and 199 (odd side, south of the Spui): a broad six-axis cornice front of brown brick, a narrow front with white block voussoirs over every window and a bracketed cornice, and an 18th-c. neck-gable house (Rijksmonument 2137: XVIIIb, claw pieces, glazing bars). Sky and crowns are washed out on the 2025-01-20 strip."
